        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The gas spore bursts [[lookup @activation.condition activity=yjZ0FEUedrdz6oQ0]].</p><p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=yjZ0FEUedrdz6oQ0]], each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=yjZ0FEUedrdz6oQ0]] in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=yjZ0FEUedrdz6oQ0]]-foot Emanation originating from the gas spore.</p><p><em>Failure:</em> The target takes [[/damage average]] damage and has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition for [[/r 1d12]] hours. Unless the Poisoned condition is removed, the target dies at the end of that time and sprouts [[/r 2d4]] Tiny @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.bestiaire.Actor.EowXkhmYYVLHH4IT]{Gas Spore Fungi} (each with 1 Hit Point). After [[/r 2d6]] days, they become Large and have 13 Hit Points.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-OrBr8LtblFp7eZE8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Lancez 1d12 pour la durée de Poisoned et réglez celle de l’effet. La mort de la cible et les nouveaux Gas Spore Fungi ne sont pas automatisés.</p></section>",
